     <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/shop\" class=\"price-link\">Inquire</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Industrial Hub Section -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20 bg-gray-900 text-white p-12 rounded-3xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-secondary\">Ahmedabad Industrial Area Rapid Support</h2>\n            <p class=\"mb-8 opacity-80\">Our service vans are stationed in these key areas to provide same-day <b>Panel AC service Ahmedabad</b> response:</p>\n            <div class=\"industrial-list text-xs uppercase tracking-wider leading-relaxed\">\n                <b>Vatva GIDC</b> | <b>Odhav GIDC</b> | <b>Naroda GIDC</b> | Sanand GIDC | Changodar Industrial Estate | Kathwada GIDC | Behrampura Industrial Area | Rakhial Industrial Area | Bapunagar Industrial Estate | Amraiwadi Industrial Estate | Vatva Industrial Estate | Narol Industrial Estate | Lambha Industrial Area | Aslali Logistics Hub | Jetalpur Industrial Zone | Bareja Industrial Area | Moraiya Industrial Estate | Bavla GIDC | Dholka GIDC | Kadi GIDC | Kalol GIDC | Chhatral GIDC | Viramgam GIDC | Mandal GIDC | Becharaji Industrial Zone | Khoraj Industrial Park | Bol GIDC (Sanand II) | Nalsarovar Industrial Zone | Detroj Industrial Area.\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- All Services We Offer -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">All Cooling Services in Ahmedabad</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden hover-card border border-gray-100\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/cold-room.webp\" alt=\"Cold Room Service Ahmedabad\" class=\"service-img\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Cold Room Solutions</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">Deep freezing and ripening chamber maintenance for Ahmedabad&#8217;s logistics sector.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-primary font-bold\">Details →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden hover-card border border-gray-100\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/deep-freezer-repair-service-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Deep Freezer Repair Ahmedabad\" class=\"service-img\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Industrial Freezers</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">Display counters and walk-in freezer repairs for the food industry.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-primary font-bold\">Details →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden hover-card border border-gray-100\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Water-Cooler-Repair-Service-near-me-in-vadodara-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Water Cooler Repair Ahmedabad\" class=\"service-img\" title=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"p-6\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Water Cooler Service</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">Ensuring fresh drinking water for plant workers in Naroda and Vatva.</p>\n                        <a href=\"/water-cooler-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-primary font-bold\">Details →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Error Codes & Solutions -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">Self-Help: Common Panel AC Error Codes</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded shadow-sm border-l-4 border-red-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold\">E0: Sensor Failure</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\">Ambient temperature sensor is disconnected. <b>Fix:</b> Inspect NTC probe wiring.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded shadow-sm border-l-4 border-red-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold\">E1: High Temp</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\">Internal cabinet heat exceeds limit. <b>Fix:</b> Clean condenser filters immediately.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded shadow-sm border-l-4 border-red-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold\">E2: Low Pressure</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\">Refrigerant leakage or evaporator icing. <b>Fix:</b> Call for <b>panel AC service Ahmedabad</b>.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded shadow-sm border-l-4 border-red-500\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold\">E3: Motor Trip</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\">Condenser fan motor drawing high amps. <b>Fix:</b> Check motor bearings.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Buy / Sell / Scrap Section -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20 bg-yellow-50 p-10 rounded-3xl border-2 border-yellow-200 text-center\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Industrial Scrap &#038; Second Hand Solutions</h2>\n            <p class=\"mb-8\">Upgrade your plant&#8217;s cooling infrastructure with Atlas Aircon. We buy old, damaged, or beyond-repair units for <b>scrap</b> and sell certified <b>used panel AC</b> units with full service history.</p>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-center gap-6\">\n                <a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"bg-gray-800 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold\">Sell Scrap Units</a>\n                <a href=\"/shop\" class=\"bg-secondary text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold\">Buy Certified Used</a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQs -->\n        <section class=\"mb-20\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title text-center\">Ahmedabad Panel AC Service FAQ</h2>\n            <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4\">\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border shadow-sm group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer\">Do you provide service in Sanand GIDC for automobile plants?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600\">Yes, we serve the entire Sanand-I and Sanand-II belts, specializing in cooling units for high-end CNC and robotic control panels.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border shadow-sm group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer\">What is the response time in Vatva GIDC?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600\">Our Vatva-based mobile units usually arrive within 2 to 4 hours for emergency thermal trips.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border shadow-sm group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer\">Can you repair Rittal units with stainless steel enclosures?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600\">Absolutely. We are experts in servicing stainless steel units used in pharmaceutical and food processing plants in Changodar and Bavla.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border shadow-sm group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer\">Do you provide AMC for large industrial parks?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600\">Yes, we manage AMCs for plants with 50+ units, providing scheduled maintenance and 24/7 emergency support.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border shadow-sm group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer\">My panel AC is vibrating heavily. What should I do?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600\">Vibration can damage machine precision and refrigerant lines. Turn off the unit and call our <b>panel AC service Ahmedabad</b> team to check the fan balance.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border shadow-sm group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer\">What is the cost of gas charging?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600\">Gas charging for industrial panel ACs starts from ₹3,500, depending on the refrigerant weight and unit capacity.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border shadow-sm group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer\">Do you use original spares?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600\">We use high-grade OEM-equivalent spares that match the original manufacturer specifications for better reliability.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border shadow-sm group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer\">Can you repair units for laser cutting machines?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600\">Yes, laser cutting panels generate intense heat. We service <b>Advance Cooling System</b> and other specialized laser hvac units.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border shadow-sm group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer\">Do you offer second-hand panel ACs?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600\">Yes, we have a revolving stock of refurbished units that are fully tested and come with a 6-month warranty.</p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-lg border shadow-sm group\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer\">Is chemical cleaning necessary for panel ACs?</summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600\">In dusty areas like Naroda and Odhav, grease and dust form a layer on coils. Chemical cleaning is vital to restore heat transfer efficiency.</p>\n                </details>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Residential Ahmedabad Areas -->\n        <section class=\"py-12 bg-white border rounded-2xl px-8 mb-20\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Residential Areas Served in Ahmedabad</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-tighter leading-relaxed\">\n                Satellite | Vastrapur | Prahlad Nagar | Bodakdev | Thaltej | Gota | Sola | Ghatlodia | Chandlodia | Ranip | Sabarmati | Motera | Chandkheda | Naroda | Nikol | Bapunagar | Amraiwadi | Maninagar | Isanpur | Ghodasar | Vatva | Lambha | Narol | Danilimda | Behrampura | Paldi | Vasna | Ambawadi | Ellis Bridge | Navrangpura | Naranpura | Memnagar | Gurukul | Drive-In | CG Road | Ashram Road | Usmanpura | Shahibaug | Camp Road | Cantonment Area | Girdharnagar | Madhavpura | Dariapur | Kalupur | Saraspur | Gomtipur | Rakhiyal | Odhav | Vastral | Ramol | Hathijan | Vinzol | Bakrol | Jetalpur | Bareja | Aslali | Changodar | Sarkhej | Jodhpur | Vejalpur | South Bopal | Bopal | Ghuma | Shela | Shilaj | Ognaj | Lapkaman | Bhadaj | Science City.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Global Reach -->\n    <section class=\"bg-primary text-white py-16 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">Cooling Ahmedabad&#8217;s Industry Since 2010</h2>\n            <p class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg mb-10\">We are your trusted technical experts for <b>Panel AC service Ahmedabad</b>. We provide reliable, fast, and professional thermal solutions for your machines.</p>\n            <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"bg-secondary text-white px-12 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-xl inline-block shadow-lg\">Call Atlas Aircon</a>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-gray-500 py-20\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 text-sm\">\n            <div>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon Logo\" class=\"h-10 mb-6 grayscale brightness-150\" title=\"\">\n                <p class=\"italic\">&#8220;Precision Cooling, Unmatched Reliability.&#8221; Serving Ahmedabad&#8217;s GIDC belts with pride.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-4 uppercase\">Services</h4>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-2\">\n                    <li><a href=\"/panel-ac-service-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Panel AC Repair</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Industrial Chillers</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Cold Storage</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/ac-service-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white\">AC Service Center</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-4 uppercase\">Hubs</h4>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-2\">\n                    <li>